window.products.push({"id":874018,"name":"DI ORO Stainless Steel Measuring Cup and Spoon Set - Metal Measuring Cups and Spoons for Baking - 8-Piece Heavy-Duty Kitchen Cooking Set - 4 Metal Mea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H84XHsOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A BETTER SOLUTION – Old plastic measuring cups and spoons belong in the trash or an antique store. A safer and healthier solution for your kitchen is the DI ORO 8-Piece Stainless Steel Measuring Cup and Spoon Set. Each spoon and cup is constructed with long and durable handles, which guarantees your hands will stay out of the food while you effortlessly add ingredients to your family’s favorite meals and desserts. LASER ETCHED AND EASY TO READ – Tired of having to use a magnifying glass or checking the measurements on your old measuring sets numerous times? Our laser etched measurements will never fade, and are large enough to read giving you 100% confidence you grabbed the right sized cup or spoon. The sizes include 1/4 cup (59 ml), 1/3 cup (79 ml), 1/2 cup (118 ml), 1 cup (237 ml). The spoons are sized as follows: 1/4 tsp (1.25ml), 1/2 tsp (2.5 ml), 1 tsp (5ml), 1 tbsp (15 ml). PREMIUM FOOD-GRADE 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL – You can sleep easy knowing your investment in the DI ORO measuring set means all 8 pieces will never rust or corrode. The longevity of your set means years of hassle-free use and easy storage. We have included two d-rings in your set so all the spoons and cups can be attached, stored together, and easily accessible. Our food-grade stainless steel is non-toxic, food safe, and built to last. HASSLE-FREE, EASY KITCHEN CLEANUP – Simply clean your measuring set pieces by hand or place them in the dishwasher. Unlike cheap plastic measuring sets, each piece in your DI ORO set is engineered to prevent the build-up of food and grime. The easy to clean design gives you the freedom to spend less time in the kitchen cleaning and more time enjoying your family. WHAT SETS US APART – Unlike other brands aiming to just sell a product to their customers, at DI ORO we aim to provide years of lasting memories and positive experiences. Our customers mean everything to us, so we have set the bar with our Forever Warranty and second to none customer service. We will replace any damaged or defective product for free or provide a full refund if you are not satisfied with your purchase; forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H84XHsOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"di Oro Living","source_asin":"B07XVTCK19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XVTCK19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XVTCK19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":874019,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Restaurant can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener! Chef's Best Choice (New-Can opener)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQlvQCWLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 3) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQlvQCWLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B07GB6S974","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GB6S974","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GB6S974","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
