window.products.push({"id":874064,"name":"3-Piece Fine Printed Duvet Cover Set King Size - 1500 Series high Thread Count Brushed Microfiber - Luxury, Soft, Durable (Yellow, Grey, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CwrefNCIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Microfiber is an all-season fabric with its ability to hold color well. Stain Resistant-People with children and those looking for sturdy material for a bedroom, children's room or RV may especially like microfiber fabric for its durability and stain resistance. The material is so tightly woven — with fibers thinner than a human hair that it naturally repels water and stains. Even highly staining substances like coffee can usually be wiped away without a trace if they are caught right away. Get a classy and comfortable finish every time you make up your room. This soft fabric resist wrinkling and fading and item comes in various colors and textures to suit your needs and decorate your homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CwrefNCIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grand Linen","source_asin":"B07998RWWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07998RWWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07998RWWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
