window.products.push({"id":874073,"name":"HOME-X Set of 2, Adhesive Towel Racks, Multifunction Rods, Durable, Multi-Surface, Easy Install Adhesive Towel Racks, White, Set of 2 Sizes, 10 ½” L a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gn5sSHQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How often have you found yourself looking for the ideal place to put your towels? Do they seem to end up on the floor more than in your hands? Your search to find the right bathroom towel rack is over! Use this set of 2 towel bars in any room in your house and for hanging any item. Try adding a hand towel rack to your bathroom to use for bath towels. Such a versatile product will make a great organizer next to the refrigerator or sink in the kitchen. They can also be used as kitchen towel hangers for those extra dish towels. They are the right size to use as a washcloth holder—they are a cute, functional item to keep your kids’ bathroom tidy! These towel bars come in one of each size 10 ½” L and 14” L both 3” W x 1 ½” H. The ridged design is even great for satin clothes or towels. These products were designed to keep you from having to spend a lot of time installing towel racks and more time enjoying their functionality. The set up for this set of 2, bathroom towel bars are as easy as can be! Simply clean the area you wish to apply the bar to, place the adhesive on the end, and press into place. Do not place anything on the bar for 24 hours to ensure proper setting. Once these adhesive racks are mounted, they are not going to budge. Simply grab your towel or laundry and you are good to go! The high quality of these hangers means that replacement towel bars should not be necessary. Such a premium design will have you turning your bathroom, kitchen, or laundry room into a functional paradise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gn5sSHQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08Q4CTJ8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q4CTJ8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q4CTJ8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
