window.products.push({"id":874126,"name":"Silicone Pastry Mat Non Stick Extra Thick Baking Mat with Measurement Fondant Mat, Counter Mat, Dough Rolling Mat,Fondant,Pie Crust Mat (XXL-20''(W)*2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qVEgBrwPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE THICKNESS: The thickness of the Mat is 0.6MM, which is almost twice that of other mats (0.3MM). Thicker mats will not slip and wrinkle when used ANTI-SLIP BOTTOM: It is strongly adhesive to the countertop or other surfaces, it does not slip and slide on the counter top and can realize complete adhesion NON-STICK & EASY TO CLEAN: Simply wash your silicone baking mat with warm soapy water or place in the dishwasher to clean. It can be stored rolled up or folded, occupying minimal space in a drawer or cupboard. Durable & Reusable:The Silicone baking mats can be used thousands of times! Heat-resistant performance in temperatures from -40 to 480 degrees Fahrenheit. Microwave, oven and freezer. Gurantee And Service:We offer a 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE If you are not satisfied with this product, please feel free to contact us for help, we will solve your problem or refund as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qVEgBrwPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RECER","source_asin":"B091TGTMK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TGTMK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TGTMK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":874127,"name":"Melange 12-Piece 100% Melamine Dinnerware Set (Clay Collection) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Plates and Bowls | Color: Navy | Dinner Pl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gx9ZGIdL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn't cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you'll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we've taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you're going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn't mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That's why we've used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone's eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gx9ZGIdL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074WFQHKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074WFQHKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074WFQHKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
