window.products.push({"id":874149,"name":"Mucha Winter European Tapestry - 18 in. x 39 in. Cotton/Polyester by Alphonse Mucha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aBROYWtXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"70% Cotton, 30% Viscose and Polyester Blend TAPESTRY ORIGIN: The wall tapestry is woven in Belgium. The woven tapestry flaunts the medieval artwork- Autumn Alphonse Mucha European tapestry'. The Belgian tapestry shows a representation of the tree of life that signifies relations between the world, heaven, and underworld. COMPOSITION: The European Wall Tapestry is made from 70% Cotton, 30% Viscose and Polyester Blend. The wall decor tapestry is jacquard woven and hand finished by skilled craftsmen with a lining and tunnel. HOME DECOR ACCENT: The tapestry wall art will add sophistication & style to your living room, family room, office, bedroom, dining room and hallway The decorative wall hanging is an exquisite decorative statement piece for any home. The tapestry presents itself as an elegant decorative accent no matter where it is hung. WEAVING TECHNIQUE: The European tapestry wall hanging is a jacquard woven masterpiece that uses specialized weaving techniques along with a combination of different yarns to create a tapestry as close as possible to the original art painting. This famous painting tapestry is woven in Belgium by European craftsmen using European jacquard weaving machines SPECIFICATIONS: The tapestry for wall is 39 in. wide and 18 in. high. This fine art tapestry uses an eclectic combination of colours Red, Cream, Blue, Green, Brown and Gold. The rods and decorative tassels are for illustration purpose only and are not included with the tapestry. The tapestry ships folded so expect transit creases which is easily removed by gently ironing the reverse side of the tapestry with a steam iron. PACKAGE INCLUDES: One Tapestry without Tapestry Rod or Tassels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aBROYWtXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C Charlotte Home Furnishings Inc.","source_asin":"B013QWKKU8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013QWKKU8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013QWKKU8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
