window.products.push({"id":874700,"name":"Crawford Kitchen Smokeless Infrared BBQ Grill | Portable Indoor Tabletop Design | 14\" Round Non-Stick Pan | Quick Cooking & Easy Cleaning (Black 14\" R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLUScXUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quicker And Healthier Meals With Less Cleanup Like traditional electric grills, the Crawford Kitchen Infrared Indoor Grill will cook your meals without added oils and while allowing the excess fats from your foods to safely drip away. However, traditional electric grills and griddles inefficiently transfer heat to your food via metal to food contact. This results in uneven cooking and wasted electricity as the entire surface is heated regardless of the amount of food being made. A much more efficient and effective alternative is infrared light. The infrared light used in the Crawford Kitchen Infrared Indoor Grill penetrates deeply within your food. This results in a much more even cooking process resulting in faster and better tasting meals. Also, because the surface is not being heated directly, you no longer have to struggle to scrub burned on grease stains. Cleaning the large round non-stick Teflon coated cooking area is quick and easy, making you look forward to the next delicious meal instead of dreading the next cleanup. Get your Crawford Kitchen Infrared Indoor Grill and make your meals healthier, and your life easier. Specifications: Size: 18\" x 14\" x 12\" 5 selectable power and auto shut-off times: Level 1 : 350 F (180 C) for 40 minutes Level 2: 375 F (190 C) for 80 minutes Level 3: 390 F (200 C) for 120 minutes Level 4: 410 F (210 C) for 160 minutes Level 5: 430 F (220 C) for 200 minutes Uses infrared heat to grill Cooks food faster than traditional griddle Easier to clean than traditional griddle Swing away infrared heat bulb with auto shut-off Removable 14\" grilling platter Easy to use analog control 1300W of power","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLUScXUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crawford Kitchen","source_asin":"B075M359TV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075M359TV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075M359TV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":874701,"name":"Enamelware - Set of 3 Storage Bowls w/Lids - Black Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818SJCEObAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crow Canyon Home set of 3 enamelware bowls with plastic lids and stainless steel rims. They are a perfect size for storing leftovers, or carrying snacks! Bowls are 2\" tall with a 5\" diameter and hold approx 12 ounces. Crow Canyon enamelware is made from high quality steel with a baked on porcelain enamel finish in a two coat process that results in a slightly textured finish. Dishwasher safe : Do not wash with hard water spot removers. Do not leave in standing water. Avoid using abrasive cleaners. Naturally non-stick, enamelware cleans up easily! Not for microwave use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818SJCEObAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crow Canyon Home","source_asin":"B07BJ8YDK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BJ8YDK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BJ8YDK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
