window.products.push({"id":874715,"name":"THREAD SPREAD Cooling 100% Tencel Lyocell Bed Sheets Set 4PC- Cool Breathable Extra Soft Sheets - Natural Silky Material, Moisture Wicking - Softest C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kl1ng9g9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥰 WORLD’S SOFTEST, COOLEST, AND MOST BREATHABLE SHEET SETS: Meet Finesse by Thread Spread. Crafted from 100% TENCEL Lyocell that is derived from natural wood sources, our Tencel sheet sets are cool-to-touch and more breathable than 100% cotton sheets, softer than linen sheets, and more sustainable than bamboo sheets. The sateen weave creates a luxuriously soft and silky texture of five-star hotel bedding. 🌿 GREAT FOR SENSITIVE SKIN; BETTER FOR THE ENVIRONMENT: Prone to acne or skin breakouts? Eucalyptus sheet sets are naturally cooling, hypoallergenic, and use skin-friendly and chemical-free dyes—making them ideal for sensitive skin. It’s great for hot sleepers who suffer from night sweats. Made in a closed-loop process, we save up to 91% of water consumption and reduce 46% of CO2 emissions and minimize the environmental impact. 🛏 4-PC KING SHEET SET (FITTED SHEET WITH DEEP POCKETS): The 4-piece King Size Tencel Sheet Set includes 1 Flat Sheet (108’ x 102’), 1 Fitted Sheet (78’ x 80’ + 16” deep pockets), and 2 King Pillowcases (21’ x 40’). The fitted sheet comes with an elastic band and extra deep pockets to fit up to 18 inch thick mattress. The head/foot tags help to make the bed easily. 💪 4X DURABLE AND STRONGER THAN OTHER FABRICS: Like your favorite cashmere, our white Tencel sheets become softer and more comfortable after every wash. We only use botanical-origin, skin-friendly dyes that make our sheets more durable. As a result, there is less wear and tear, and the sheets don’t pill or fade easily. Machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Do not bleach or tumble dry. Tencel king sheets are wrinkle resistant—but you can iron them lightly after the wash if needed. 💚 THE ECO-FRIENDLY PROMISE OF THREAD SPREAD: From eco-conscious production to plastic-free packaging, we do as much as we can for our environment. Our top quality hotel collection sheets are manufactured in a certified facility with strict labor laws and ethical standards to create genuine, safe-to-use. Whether it’s Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Winter Holidays, Valentine’s Day, Thanksgiving, or a wedding, our best cooling sheets are a unique gift for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kl1ng9g9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B0BN65DQPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN65DQPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN65DQPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
