window.products.push({"id":874845,"name":"Norpro Nonstick More-Than-a-Muffin-Pan, Mini, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bBG5t+TrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Measures: 17\" x 12\" x 1.25\" / 43cm x 30.5cm x 1.25cm.Cup Measures: Top-1.75\"/4.5cm, Bottom-1.25\"/3cm, Depth-.75\"/2cm.Uniquely designed wide lip edge is ideal for ease in handling. Makes 24 mini muffins, cupcakes, brownies, bite-size quiche, mini delicacies or hor d' oeuvres. Made of carbon steel with a premium food safe, PFOA free, nonstick coating for easy release and cleaning. Hand washing recommended. Norpro was founded in 1973 with a vision to design, manufacture, and supply the highest caliber kitchenware. Norpro’s offering of innovative, high quality product for cooking, preparing and serving food are produced with superior materials and craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bBG5t+TrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norpro","source_asin":"B01I47YTHU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I47YTHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I47YTHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":874846,"name":"N&T NIETING Artificial Orchid Phalaenopsis Flower, 2PCS 29in Real Touch Simulation Orchild with Stem for Wedding, Flower Arrangement, Home Centerpiece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WwAhKyi3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"REALISTIC LOOKING: Crafted from real-touch PEVA material and coated with latex instead of cheap-looking silk, the artifical orchid has a surprisingly realistic appearance and will leave you feeling as if you’re among the gorgeous sand dunes and golden skies of Morocco. A phalaenopsis that not only looks real but also feels real is the one that a ture florist will adore. VERSATILE SIZE: The stem of the artificial orchid measures 15.2in/39cm and blooms 13.8in/35cm, sized perfectly to be applicable for various floral arrangements. The artificial orchids can be left alone in a vase for a contemporary style of looking and they can also be paired with luxuriously decorated bouquet or large floral centerpiece. Create your unique flower display in mind and make it happen with fuax orchids plant. USE WITH NO WORRIES: The paint used has been tested as waterproof and non-toxic, which makes it possible to submerge the orchids in water and the color won’t bleed. The stems are smooth to the touch and won’t cut your hand accidentally when holding them. The blooms are also attached firmly to each branches which are very durable and made to last. SUPERB CONVENIENCE: Like authentic flowers, these fakes flowers are elegant and serves the purpose of decorating your home very well, and unlike authentic flowers, these artificial flowers can keep your home beautiful and dreamlike for years to come with no extra care needed, if you are looking for a long-lasting solution for your home decor, this is the one. Please note that our lifelike Phalaenopsis Orchid DO NOT come with any container. N&T NIETING takes pride in all of our designs. If for some reason you are unsatisfied with your purchase or it is damaged during delivery, please contact us. Due to the nature of the material, the shape and color of each flower may slightly vary from the ones in the picture, but it won’t affect the performance of this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WwAhKyi3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N&T NIETING","source_asin":"B07VYYFF1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VYYFF1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VYYFF1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
