window.products.push({"id":874856,"name":"100% Cotton Blanket Twin Herringbone SAGE Soft Throw Bed Blanket Thermal Breathable Bed Blanket Light Weight Blanket (SAGE, 66X90)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EhkRqknCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in India :Our handmade blanket is woven with care and warmth of love and gives you good sleep. Oeko Tex Certified :It is Oeko-Tex certified , confirming the human-ecological safety of textile products and leather articles from all stages of production .It maintains skin-friendly pH value and good color fastness. BCI(Better Cotton Intiative ): An initiative that develops and promotes good farm practices, allowing more cotton to be grown while reducing water and chemical use and protecting both working conditions ,customers skin and biodiversity Light weight :It is thick and plush yet light in weight which makes it easy to be carried in travel too. With this blanket you will drown in silky smoothiness every season. Beautifies your home:We set our mission to not only deliver not only the coziest and most comfortable on market but to also add to your homedecor with more of comfort. Vibrant Colours:We have vibrant colours for you to choose.It blends you in all kind of styles. Seamless stitchings : It is neatly stiched with strong connections at seams.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EhkRqknCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMkras","source_asin":"B092WRFXTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092WRFXTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092WRFXTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":874857,"name":"Cunill Danube 925 Sterling Silver 8x10 Picture Frame Personalized, Custom Engraved Silver Picture Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMnyq+nlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUNILL DANUBE STERLING SILVER 8X10 PICTURE FRAME The Danube has been a Cunill favorite for decades. This 8x10 frame features a simplified border that is narrow yet not too narrow to engrave on. This frame is stunning in person and draws the eye bringing attention to the precious photograph that it surrounds while serving to elegantly protect, display, and accent any precious photograph with a sleek, modern touch. A frame truly worthy of your most treasured memories such as wedding or anniversary photos, this 8x10 frame is crafted from beautiful .925 sterling silver with sleek lines and a simplistic modern style that adds a lovely touch to any home or office's decor. Featuring a beautifully mirror-polished finish and gracefully rounded corners, this frame handsomely accents any table, mantle, or desktop. The versatile two-way easel sits vertically (portrait) or horizontally (landscape) to accommodate either style of photograph.  Cunill sterling silver frames are hand crafted in Italy, from the wood back and easel to the silver with the pattern stamped using stainless steel tooling. There are no imported parts, and each frame is made using superior grade .925 sterling silver and genuine wood, finished with a beautiful cherry mahogany and high gloss lacquer. Cunill frames never need polishing as the silver is treated with a tarnish proof finish. The signature 2-piece luxury gift box makes for a truly impressive presentation. PERSONALIZED ENGRAVING Make this elegant picture frame one of a kind by adding a custom engraving. Choose a font and add your own custom monogram or text of up to two lines (one on top of the frame, one on the bottom), 20 characters max per line. ORDERING INSTRUCTIONS Click 'Customize Now' to begin your order and review font options. Just select your font and enter the text to be engraved on each line. Our engraving specialists will take care of the rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMnyq+nlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cunill","source_asin":"B08667S8Q5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08667S8Q5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08667S8Q5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
