window.products.push({"id":874904,"name":"CUSTOM CUT - Oval Closet Rod |Up to 24\" |Screw-on Wall Brackets |Polished Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wV7s-Bo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Help Has Arrived!!!! Upgrading your closet is supposed to be easy, except for the dreaded chore of cutting the rod to length because it's a HUGE HEADACHE. The slipping hacksaw blade, the crooked cuts, the jagged edges... Arrrrg! Well, those days are over and your life just got 10X easier. We got this! Easy-Peezy Ordering Just click the \"Customize Now\" button and enter the size you need (to the nearest 1/16\"). We'll take care of deducting for the thickness of the wall brackets. Strength You Can Count On! Don't be fooled by other choices that may appear to be the same, because all rods are not created equal! Ours is a robust 22 ga., far thicker than most others. Oval shape really resists bending! Beautiful Finish The heavier steel that goes into our closet poles is the perfect foundation for a fantastic finish. The chrome has a beautiful shine which will keep looking like new for years to come! Designer End Supports The 2 provided end supports are just as nice! They're made of cast metal (not stamped steel) Installation Options These rods can be installed on virtually any surface. If you have your own wood cleating already in place, use the provided 1\" screws. If you wish to go directly over sheet rock, you can do that as well, because hollow wall anchors are included for your convenience! Once the ends are installed, just drop the rod in place, sit back, and admire your good work! Here's what you get... - 1 custom-cut polished chrome oval rod up to 24\" long- 2 polished chrome end supports- Matching polished chrome mounting screws and hollow wall anchors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wV7s-Bo-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Desunia","source_asin":"B0BQFQS84G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-874904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQFQS84G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQFQS84G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
